====Malleability====

Malleability is the ability for a third party (''not'' a participant in the script) to modify an
existing satisfaction into another valid satisfaction. To analyze the malleability guarantees of a
script we define three additional type properties: "'''s'''" (signed), "'''f'''" (forced) and
"'''e'''" (expressive).

